cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RoboProbe or its design in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "RoboProbe: Intelligent Virtual Robotics Testing & Failure Discovery Platform"
abstract: >-
  RoboProbe is an open-source, software-only testing layer for autonomous robots that runs on top of an
  established simulator (Gazebo Harmonic with ROS 2 Jazzy and Nav2). It generates and adaptively selects
  test scenarios using Gaussian-process Bayesian optimisation on a continuous robustness score, detects
  failures with temporal-logic-style oracles, clusters and explains failure modes, and maps safe,
  uncertain and failure-prone regions of the scenario space.
type: software
authors:
